WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Use a known lab
Open Wi-Fi or BLE observations for equipment you own or are permitted to test. Check capabilities and start one observation task.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Confirm actual input
Look for your known device and changing timestamps. Preview fixtures and a connected badge are not evidence of received radio events.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Save a useful result
Export a small observation set and inspect the file. Remove personal identifiers before sharing a report or screenshot.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Stop and reconnect
Stop the task and confirm its result. Check rotation and reconnect separately. BLE advertisements do not guarantee a popup on another operating system.
